   "seed": 789768966,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2006773324,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "For each airline, try billed weight w ∈ { chargeable } ∪ { every bracket start above it }:\n    freight(w) = max( minimum, w × rate(bracket of w) )\n    total(w)   = freight(w) + (fuel + security) × w   (+ trucker price if door-to-port)\n    price      = min over w  of total(w)      ← weight-break trick: heavier can be cheaper\nOnly ~7 brackets → ≤ 8 tries per airline → microseconds. Round to 2 decimals, keep currency.",
   "originalText": "For each airline, try billed weight w ∈ { chargeable } ∪ { every bracket start above it }:\n    freight(w) = max( minimum, w × rate(bracket of w) )\n    total(w)   = freight(w) + (fuel + security) × w   (+ trucker price if door-to-port)\n    price      = min over w  of total(w)      ← weight-break trick: heavier can be cheaper\nOnly ~7 brackets → ≤ 8 tries per airline → microseconds. Round to 2 decimals, keep currency.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "ec7f256c7",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
