   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Credit budget per request\n\nHappy path (most RFQs):\n• regex parse ............ $0\n• rate sheets + portal .. $0 LLM\n• pricing math ........... $0\n• 1 nano call for reply ≈ $0.0001\n\nWorst case:\n• + extract call ......... ≈ $0.0002\n• + bid-email parsing ... ≈ $0.0002\n• total still ≪ $0.10 limit\n\nDon't:\n• let an agent loop decide prices\n• send whole tariffs to the LLM\n• use big models (gpt-4o, o-series)\n• call LLM per candidate airline",
   "originalText": "Credit budget per request\n\nHappy path (most RFQs):\n• regex parse ............ $0\n• rate sheets + portal .. $0 LLM\n• pricing math ........... $0\n• 1 nano call for reply ≈ $0.0001\n\nWorst case:\n• + extract call ......... ≈ $0.0002\n• + bid-email parsing ... ≈ $0.0002\n• total still ≪ $0.10 limit\n\nDon't:\n• let an agent loop decide prices\n• send whole tariffs to the LLM\n• use big models (gpt-4o, o-series)\n• call LLM per candidate airline",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "ec4f02538",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
