   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Speed plan (15 pts)\n\nt = 0 s    RFQ in, parse, email truckers\nt ≈ 2 s    sheets priced\nt ≈ 5 s    portal /rates back\nt ≈ 10 s   reply sent (if no email needed)\nt ≤ 100 s  hard cutoff when waiting on bids\n\nPoll mailbox every 1–2 s.\nPre-load all tariffs before 16:00.",
   "originalText": "Speed plan (15 pts)\n\nt = 0 s    RFQ in, parse, email truckers\nt ≈ 2 s    sheets priced\nt ≈ 5 s    portal /rates back\nt ≈ 10 s   reply sent (if no email needed)\nt ≤ 100 s  hard cutoff when waiting on bids\n\nPoll mailbox every 1–2 s.\nPre-load all tariffs before 16:00.",
   "fontSize": 16,
